      "math_academy_id": "q-140115",
      "sequence_position": 2,
      "problem": "Let $b=[\\begin{aligned}12 \\\\ 30 \\\\ 12 \\\\ 24\\end{aligned}]$ and $a=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Find the orthogonal projection of $b$ onto $\\text{Span}\\{a\\}.$",
      "worked_solution": "The vector projection of $b$ onto $\\text{Span}\\{a\\}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{proj}}_{a}\\,b & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{a\\cdot a}a \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 12+(-1)\\cdot 30+0\\cdot 12+1\\cdot 24}{{1}^{2}+(-1)^{2}+{0}^{2}+{1}^{2}}a \\\\  & =\\frac{12-30+0+24}{1+1+0+1}a \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{3}a \\\\  & =2a \\\\  & =2[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
